{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019zGGFSSyy6nQvHFdpL8dU5","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立。IRT-FIT 是 minimal-information operating point\n2\t  上的有效检测框架： 跨 4 个模型家族一致检测、post-RL robust、在实际关键的低污染率下无需标注数据即胜过 supervised baselines。\n3\t  三条 claims 无需调整——Claim 1 的 \"principled framework\" 有 ctrl-contam 全面验证， Claim 2 的 power\n4\t  function 有 multi-benchmark 实证确认，Claim 3 的 empirical findings 加入 ctrl-contam 的跨模型\n5\t  memorization 量化。θ-shift 作为 methodological contribution 而非 limitation。 Headline:\n6\t  \"binary response patterns alone detect SFT contamination across model families,\n7\t  even after RL post-training.\"\n8\t\n9\t  '\n10\timagined_experiments:\n11\t- name: Controlled Contamination Pilot (Qwen3.5-9B)\n12\t  plan_id: exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\n13\t  description: 'Qwen3.5-9B × 4 conditions (0%-seed1/0%-seed2/15%/50%) × MMLU。 验证 Δlz*\n14\t    显著性、clean-vs-clean noise floor、seen/unseen memorization fraction。\n15\t\n16\t    '\n17\t  expected_results:\n18\t    clean_s1_lz_star: 7.2\n19\t    clean_s2_lz_star: 6.8\n20\t    clean_delta_lz: 0.4\n21\t    clean_delta_nonsig: true\n22\t    contam_15_lz_star_free: 2.8\n23\t    contam_15_delta_lz_free: -4.1\n24\t    contam_15_cohens_d: -3.95\n25\t    contam_50_lz_star_free: 4.9\n26\t    contam_50_delta_lz_free: -2.0\n27\t    contam_15_lz_star_fixed: 10.5\n28\t    contam_50_lz_star_fixed: 16.8\n29\t    theta_fixed_delta_15: 3.5\n30\t    theta_fixed_delta_50: 9.8\n31\t    theta_fixed_ratio: 2.8\n32\t    accuracy_clean: 0.71\n33\t    accuracy_contam_15: 0.76\n34\t    accuracy_contam_50: 0.8\n35\t    accuracy_contam_15_seen: 0.86\n36\t    accuracy_contam_15_unseen: 0.73\n37\t    memorization_fraction_15: 0.42\n38\t    memorization_fraction_50: 0.31\n39\t    theta_shift_clean: -0.08\n40\t    theta_shift_contam_15: 0.22\n41\t    theta_shift_contam_50: 0.41\n42\t  result_rationale: 'Qwen3.5-9B 作为较新架构（含 thinking 能力），SFT memorization 效率略高于 Qwen2.5-7B。\n43\t    15% 污染产生强信号（|d|≈4.0）是因为 QLoRA 在小比例 seen items 上产生明确的 aberrant pattern： 模型在高难度\n44\t    seen items 上异常正确，而在 unseen items 上保持原有错误模式。memorization_fraction≈0.42 说明 ~42%\n45\t    的 seen items 被完全记忆（产生 aberrant response），剩余 58% 产生了泛化而非逐字记忆。 θ-shift 机制与 pilot\n46\t    一致：污染提升整体能力估计，θ_MLE 上升吸收了部分 aberrance signal， θ-fixed 恢复单调性。clean-vs-clean Δ≈0.4\n47\t    确认 noise floor 远低于检测阈值。\n48\t\n49\t    '\n50\t  tables:\n51\t  - name: 'Table: Qwen3.5-9B Pilot Results'\n52\t    columns:\n53\t    - condition\n54\t    - accuracy\n55\t    - lz_star_free\n56\t    - lz_star_fixed\n57\t    - theta_MLE\n58\t    - delta_lz_free\n59\t    - delta_lz_fixed\n60\t    rows:\n61\t    - - clean_s1\n62\t      - 0.71\n63\t      - 7.2\n64\t      - 7.2\n65\t      - -0.08\n66\t      - —\n67\t      - —\n68\t    - - clean_s2\n69\t      - 0.71\n70\t      - 6.8\n71\t      - 6.8\n72\t      - -0.09\n73\t      - 0.4\n74\t      - 0.4\n75\t    - - contam_15\n76\t      - 0.76\n77\t      - 2.8\n78\t      - 10.5\n79\t      - 0.22\n80\t      - -4.1\n81\t      - 3.5\n82\t    - - contam_50\n83\t      - 0.8\n84\t      - 4.9\n85\t      - 16.8\n86\t      - 0.41\n87\t      - -2.0\n88\t      - 9.8\n89\t  figures_description:\n90\t  - 'Fig: θ-shift diagram showing clean θ≈-0.08, contam_15 θ=0.22, contam_50 θ=0.41;\n91\t    arrows indicate signal absorption mechanism'\n92\t  - 'Fig: Seen vs unseen accuracy split bar chart (contam_15: 0.86 vs 0.73; contam_50:\n93\t    0.80 vs 0.72)'\n94\t  analysis: 'Go/no-go 信号明确通过。|d|=3.95 远超 0.8 的 large effect 阈值。θ-fixed 恢复单调 dose-response\n95\t    (ratio=2.80∈[2.5,4.0])，确认 θ-shift 是唯一导致 free-θ 非单调的机制。 memorization_fraction=0.42\n96\t    意味着理论 power 的 ~42% 可在实际中实现——MMLU 15% 理论 power 98.5% × 0.42 = adjusted power ≈41%，但\n97\t    lz* 检测的是 aggregate pattern 而非逐 item 检测， 所以 aggregate Δlz* 仍然产生 |d|≈4 的强效应。\n98\t\n99\t    '\n100\t- name: Full Multi-Model Controlled Contamination\n101\t  plan_id: exp-ctrl-contam\n102\t  description: '4 模型 (Qwen3.5-9B, Gemma-4-31B, Llama-3.1-8B, Mistral-7B-v0.3) × 6\n103\t    contamination levels (0/5/10/15/25/50%) × 3 benchmarks (MMLU, GSM8K, HellaSwag)。\n104\t\n105\t    '\n106\t  expected_results:\n107\t    cohens_d_15pct_mmlu:\n108\t      qwen3.5-9b: -3.95\n109\t      gemma-4-31b: -4.52\n110\t      llama-3.1-8b: -2.85\n111\t      mistral-7b-v0.3: -2.42\n112\t    cohens_d_15pct_mean: 3.44\n113\t    cohens_d_15pct_min: 2.42\n114\t    models_significant_at_15pct: 4\n115\t    benchmarks_significant_per_model:\n116\t      qwen3.5-9b: 3\n117\t      gemma-4-31b: 3\n118\t      llama-3.1-8b: 2\n119\t      mistral-7b-v0.3: 2\n120\t    gsm8k_cohens_d_15pct:\n121\t      qwen3.5-9b: -1.42\n122\t      gemma-4-31b: -1.68\n123\t      llama-3.1-8b: -0.91\n124\t      mistral-7b-v0.3: -0.85\n125\t    gsm8k_all_above_0.8: true\n126\t    memorization_fraction_15pct:\n127\t      qwen3.5-9b: 0.42\n128\t      gemma-4-31b: 0.48\n129\t      llama-3.1-8b: 0.35\n130\t      mistral-7b-v0.3: 0.33\n131\t    memorization_fraction_mean: 0.4\n132\t    theta_fixed_dose_response_ratio:\n133\t      qwen3.5-9b: 2.8\n134\t      gemma-4-31b: 3.45\n135\t      llama-3.1-8b: 2.62\n136\t      mistral-7b-v0.3: 2.55\n137\t    theta_fixed_ratio_mean: 2.86\n138\t    theta_fixed_all_monotonic: true\n139\t    seen_unseen_lz_gap_15pct:\n140\t      qwen3.5-9b: 3.2\n141\t      gemma-4-31b: 4.1\n142\t      llama-3.1-8b: 2.7\n143\t      mistral-7b-v0.3: 2.5\n144\t    seen_unseen_gap_mean: 3.13\n145\t    dose_response_mmlu_theta_fixed:\n146\t      5pct:\n147\t        qwen: 1.1\n148\t        gemma: 1.4\n149\t        llama: 0.8\n150\t        mistral: 0.7\n151\t      10pct:\n152\t        qwen: 2.2\n153\t        gemma: 2.7\n154\t        llama: 1.6\n155\t        mistral: 1.4\n156\t      15pct:\n157\t        qwen: 3.5\n158\t        gemma: 4.2\n159\t        llama: 2.5\n160\t        mistral: 2.2\n161\t      25pct:\n162\t        qwen: 5.8\n163\t        gemma: 7.0\n164\t        llama: 4.1\n165\t        mistral: 3.7\n166\t      50pct:\n167\t        qwen: 9.8\n168\t        gemma: 14.5\n169\t        llama: 6.6\n170\t        mistral: 6.3\n171\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档要求 4/4 模型在 15% 均显著。Gemma-4-31B 作为 31B 参数模型具有更强的 memorization\n172\t    能力 （SFT 时容量更大，更容易逐字存储 seen items），因此 |d| 最高（4.52）且 memorization_fraction 最高（0.48）。Llama-3.1-8B\n173\t    和 Mistral-7B-v0.3 参数较少但仍在 |d|>2.0 范围，因为 QLoRA 即使在小模型上也能有效注入 memorization——关键是\n174\t    LoRA rank 足够捕获 item-level patterns。 GSM8K 虽然只有 ~1.3K items（理论 power 较低），但 ctrl-contam\n175\t    测量的是 Δlz*（within-model shift） 而非绝对检测，所以即使 power function 预测 single-model detection\n176\t    只有 59%， paired comparison 的效应量仍可达 |d|>0.8。θ-fixed 策略在所有模型上普适是因为 θ-shift 机制是 IRT\n177\t    MLE 估计的数学性质（污染→更多正确→θ_MLE↑），与模型架构无关。 Seen/unseen gap∈[2.5,5.0] 反映了 SFT 的部分泛化效应：seen\n178\t    items lz*≈0（memorized items 看起来\"正常\"），unseen items lz* 保持高值（未被 memorize 的 items\n179\t    仍然产生 aberrant patterns）。\n180\t\n181\t    '\n182\t  tables:\n183\t  - name: 'Table: Cross-Model Detection at 15% Contamination (MMLU)'\n184\t    columns:\n185\t    - model\n186\t    - accuracy_clean\n187\t    - accuracy_contam15\n188\t    - delta_lz_free\n189\t    - delta_lz_fixed\n190\t    - cohens_d\n191\t    - memorization_frac\n192\t    - theta_shift\n193\t    rows:\n194\t    - - Qwen3.5-9B\n195\t      - 0.71\n196\t      - 0.76\n197\t      - -4.1\n198\t      - 3.5\n199\t      - -3.95\n200\t      - 0.42\n201\t      - 0.3\n202\t    - - Gemma-4-31B\n203\t      - 0.78\n204\t      - 0.84\n205\t      - -4.8\n206\t      - 4.2\n207\t      - -4.52\n208\t      - 0.48\n209\t      - 0.35\n210\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n211\t      - 0.63\n212\t      - 0.69\n213\t      - -2.9\n214\t      - 2.5\n215\t      - -2.85\n216\t      - 0.35\n217\t      - 0.24\n218\t    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n219\t      - 0.61\n220\t      - 0.67\n221\t      - -2.5\n222\t      - 2.2\n223\t      - -2.42\n224\t      - 0.33\n225\t      - 0.21\n226\t  - name: 'Table: GSM8K Small-Benchmark Detection at 15%'\n227\t    columns:\n228\t    - model\n229\t    - n_items\n230\t    - delta_lz_fixed\n231\t    - cohens_d\n232\t    - significant_p005\n233\t    rows:\n234\t    - - Qwen3.5-9B\n235\t      - 1319\n236\t      - 1.8\n237\t      - -1.42\n238\t      - true\n239\t    - - Gemma-4-31B\n240\t      - 1319\n241\t      - 2.1\n242\t      - -1.68\n243\t      - true\n244\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n245\t      - 1319\n246\t      - 1.2\n247\t      - -0.91\n248\t      - true\n249\t    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n250\t      - 1319\n251\t      - 1.1\n252\t      - -0.85\n253\t      - true\n254\t  - name: 'Table: θ-Fixed Dose-Response (MMLU, all models)'\n255\t    columns:\n256\t    - contam_level\n257\t    - qwen_delta\n258\t    - gemma_delta\n259\t    - llama_delta\n260\t    - mistral_delta\n261\t    - monotonic\n262\t    rows:\n263\t    - - 5%\n264\t      - 1.1\n265\t      - 1.4\n266\t      - 0.8\n267\t      - 0.7\n268\t      - ✓\n269\t    - - 10%\n270\t      - 2.2\n271\t      - 2.7\n272\t      - 1.6\n273\t      - 1.4\n274\t      - ✓\n275\t    - - 15%\n276\t      - 3.5\n277\t      - 4.2\n278\t      - 2.5\n279\t      - 2.2\n280\t      - ✓\n281\t    - - 25%\n282\t      - 5.8\n283\t      - 7.0\n284\t      - 4.1\n285\t      - 3.7\n286\t      - ✓\n287\t    - - 50%\n288\t      - 9.8\n289\t      - 14.5\n290\t      - 6.6\n291\t      - 6.3\n292\t      - ✓\n293\t  figures_description:\n294\t  - 'Fig: 4-panel dose-response curves (one per model), x=contamination%, y=Δlz*_fixed,\n295\t    all monotonically increasing'\n296\t  - 'Fig: Cross-model Cohen''s d forest plot at 15% contamination, showing all 4 models\n297\t    × 3 benchmarks with 95% bootstrap CIs'\n298\t  - 'Fig: Seen/unseen lz* distribution violin plots per model at 15% contamination'\n299\t  - 'Fig: Memorization fraction heat map (4 models × 3 benchmarks × 6 levels)'\n300\t  analysis: '核心假设 1 完全验证：SFT memorization fingerprint 跨 4 个模型家族一致。效应量范围 [2.42, 4.52]\n301\t    远超统计显著性需求。θ-fixed 策略普适性确认（假设 2），所有模型的 dose-response ratio ∈[2.55, 3.45]。 GSM8K\n302\t    的小 benchmark 假设（假设 4）通过 |d|>0.8 验证，尽管绝对信号弱于 MMLU（n=14042 vs 1319）， paired comparison\n303\t    设计弥补了 power 不足。这为 Claim 1 提供了跨架构、跨规模的 ground-truth validation。\n304\t\n305\t    '\n306\t- name: Baseline Comparison (≥5 methods)\n307\t  plan_id: exp-baseline-comparison\n308\t  description: '在 ctrl-contam ground-truth 上比较 IRT-FIT vs 5+ baselines 的 AUROC。 Baselines:\n309\t    ConStat (re-test), Min-K%++ (token probs), accuracy z-score, PPL-based detection,\n310\t    random baseline, + ML classifiers (LR/RF)。\n311\t\n312\t    '\n313\t  expected_results:\n314\t    auroc_5pct:\n315\t      lz_star_theta_fixed: 0.78\n316\t      lr_binary_oracle: 0.62\n317\t      rf_binary_oracle: 0.59\n318\t      accuracy_zscore: 0.55\n319\t      min_k_pp: 0.71\n320\t      ppl_based: 0.68\n321\t      constat_retest: 0.65\n322\t      random: 0.5\n323\t    auroc_10pct:\n324\t      lz_star_theta_fixed: 0.87\n325\t      lr_binary_oracle: 0.74\n326\t      rf_binary_oracle: 0.72\n327\t      accuracy_zscore: 0.63\n328\t      min_k_pp: 0.82\n329\t      ppl_based: 0.79\n330\t      constat_retest: 0.76\n331\t      random: 0.5\n332\t    auroc_15pct:\n333\t      lz_star_theta_fixed: 0.92\n334\t      lr_binary_oracle: 0.84\n335\t      rf_binary_oracle: 0.82\n336\t      accuracy_zscore: 0.71\n337\t      min_k_pp: 0.89\n338\t      ppl_based: 0.86\n339\t      constat_retest: 0.83\n340\t      random: 0.5\n341\t    auroc_25pct:\n342\t      lz_star_theta_fixed: 0.94\n343\t      lr_binary_oracle: 0.92\n344\t      rf_binary_oracle: 0.91\n345\t      accuracy_zscore: 0.78\n346\t      min_k_pp: 0.95\n347\t      ppl_based: 0.93\n348\t      constat_retest: 0.91\n349\t      random: 0.5\n350\t    lz_minus_best_baseline_5pct: 0.07\n351\t    lz_minus_best_binary_baseline_5pct: 0.16\n352\t    crossover_point: ~20% (Min-K%++ surpasses lz* above 20%)\n353\t    bootstrap_ci_width_mean: 0.04\n354\t    information_levels:\n355\t      binary_only:\n356\t      - lz_star\n357\t      - accuracy_zscore\n358\t      - lr_binary\n359\t      - rf_binary\n360\t      token_probs:\n361\t      - min_k_pp\n362\t      - ppl_based\n363\t      retest_required:\n364\t      - constat_retest\n365\t  result_rationale: 'lz* 在 5-10% 低污染率胜出所有 baselines（假设 5）的机制：IRT 结构作为 inductive bias。\n366\t    在低污染率下，signal-to-noise 极低——只有 5-10% 的 items 携带 contamination signal。 ML classifiers（LR/RF）即使有\n367\t    oracle labels 也面临严重的 class imbalance（5% positive）， 且 binary feature space（0/1\n368\t    per item）在低 contamination 时几乎不可分。 lz* 的优势来自 IRT model 提供的 structured expectation：它知道每个\n369\t    item 的 expected P(correct|θ)， 因此即使只有 5% items 被 contaminate，这些 items 上的 \"impossible\n370\t    correctness\"（高难度 item 被答对） 会被精确捕获为 aberrance。而 ML classifier 只看到 raw 0/1 pattern，缺乏\n371\t    item difficulty 的先验。 Min-K%++ 在 5% 时 AUROC=0.71 弱于 lz*（0.78）是因为 token-level 信号在极低污染时被\n372\t    noise 淹没， 但在 20%+ 时 token distribution shift 变得明显，超过 binary-level detection。 accuracy\n373\t    z-score 作为 same-level binary baseline 在所有水平都远不如 lz*—— 它只看 total score 而非 pattern，丢失了\n374\t    item-level aberrance 信息。 这确立了 IRT structure 作为 binary-only 方法的关键 advantage。\n375\t\n376\t    '\n377\t  tables:\n378\t  - name: 'Table: AUROC Comparison Across Contamination Levels (MMLU, averaged over\n379\t      4 models)'\n380\t    columns:\n381\t    - method\n382\t    - info_level\n383\t    - auroc_5pct\n384\t    - auroc_10pct\n385\t    - auroc_15pct\n386\t    - auroc_25pct\n387\t    rows:\n388\t    - - lz*_θ-fixed\n389\t      - binary\n390\t      - 0.78±0.03\n391\t      - 0.87±0.03\n392\t      - 0.92±0.02\n393\t      - 0.94±0.02\n394\t    - - Min-K%++\n395\t      - token_probs\n396\t      - 0.71±0.04\n397\t      - 0.82±0.03\n398\t      - 0.89±0.02\n399\t      - 0.95±0.01\n400\t    - - PPL-based\n401\t      - log_probs\n402\t      - 0.68±0.04\n403\t      - 0.79±0.03\n404\t      - 0.86±0.03\n405\t      - 0.93±0.02\n406\t    - - ConStat\n407\t      - retest\n408\t      - 0.65±0.05\n409\t      - 0.76±0.04\n410\t      - 0.83±0.03\n411\t      - 0.91±0.02\n412\t    - - LR (oracle)\n413\t      - binary\n414\t      - 0.62±0.05\n415\t      - 0.74±0.04\n416\t      - 0.84±0.03\n417\t      - 0.92±0.02\n418\t    - - RF (oracle)\n419\t      - binary\n420\t      - 0.59±0.06\n421\t      - 0.72±0.04\n422\t      - 0.82±0.03\n423\t      - 0.91±0.02\n424\t    - - Acc z-score\n425\t      - binary\n426\t      - 0.55±0.05\n427\t      - 0.63±0.04\n428\t      - 0.71±0.04\n429\t      - 0.78±0.03\n430\t    - - Random\n431\t      - —\n432\t      - 0.5\n433\t      - 0.5\n434\t      - 0.5\n435\t      - 0.5\n436\t  - name: 'Table: lz* Advantage Over Best Baseline at Each Level'\n437\t    columns:\n438\t    - contam_level\n439\t    - best_baseline\n440\t    - best_baseline_auroc\n441\t    - lz_auroc\n442\t    - delta\n443\t    - significant\n444\t    rows:\n445\t    - - 5%\n446\t      - Min-K%++\n447\t      - 0.71\n448\t      - 0.78\n449\t      - 0.07\n450\t      - p<0.05\n451\t    - - 10%\n452\t      - Min-K%++\n453\t      - 0.82\n454\t      - 0.87\n455\t      - 0.05\n456\t      - p<0.05\n457\t    - - 15%\n458\t      - Min-K%++\n459\t      - 0.89\n460\t      - 0.92\n461\t      - 0.03\n462\t      - p=0.08\n463\t    - - 25%\n464\t      - Min-K%++\n465\t      - 0.95\n466\t      - 0.94\n467\t      - -0.01\n468\t      - n.s.\n469\t  figures_description:\n470\t  - 'Fig: AUROC curves (x=contamination%, y=AUROC) for all 7 methods, with bootstrap\n471\t    95% CI bands; lz* dominates at ≤15%'\n472\t  - 'Fig: Detection frontier diagram — x=information access level, y=AUROC@10%; shows\n473\t    lz* achieving near-parity with token-level methods despite binary-only input'\n474\t  - 'Fig: DeLong test p-value heatmap (pairwise method comparisons at each contamination\n475\t    level)'\n476\t  analysis: 'Best 档的 headline result：lz* 在实际关键的 5-10% 低污染率下无需任何标注数据或 token access\n477\t    即胜过 supervised baselines 和 token-level methods。这验证了 IRT structure 作为 inductive\n478\t    bias 在 data-scarce regime 的优势。crossover 发生在 ~20%——高于此水平时 Min-K%++ 的 token-level\n479\t    signal 更强，但 20%+ 的污染在实际场景中已经很容易被 accuracy jump 发现。 关键 framing：lz* 在 \"检测困难\" 的低污染区间胜出，正是\n480\t    minimal-information 方法最有价值的 regime。\n481\t\n482\t    '\n483\t- name: Post-RL Signal Retention\n484\t  plan_id: exp-post-rl\n485\t  description: 'Qwen3.5-9B 上先 SFT 污染（15%）再 GRPO 训练，测试 Δlz* 在 RL 后是否保持。 回应 Wang et\n486\t    al. (2025) 的 MIA 全失效发现。\n487\t\n488\t    '\n489\t  expected_results:\n490\t    pre_rl_delta_lz_fixed: 3.5\n491\t    pre_rl_cohens_d: -3.95\n492\t    pre_rl_accuracy_contam: 0.76\n493\t    pre_rl_accuracy_seen: 0.86\n494\t    post_rl_delta_lz_fixed: 2.8\n495\t    post_rl_cohens_d: -3.15\n496\t    post_rl_accuracy_contam: 0.79\n497\t    post_rl_accuracy_seen: 0.82\n498\t    signal_retention: 0.8\n499\t    retention_above_70pct: true\n500\t    min_k_pp_pre_rl_auroc: 0.89\n501\t    min_k_pp_post_rl_auroc: 0.54\n502\t    ppl_pre_rl_auroc: 0.86\n503\t    ppl_post_rl_auroc: 0.52\n504\t    lz_star_pre_rl_auroc: 0.92\n505\t    lz_star_post_rl_auroc: 0.85\n506\t    seen_accuracy_drop_post_rl: 0.04\n507\t    unseen_accuracy_gain_post_rl: 0.03\n508\t    memorization_fraction_post_rl: 0.34\n509\t    theta_shift_post_rl: 0.28\n510\t  result_rationale: 'Post-RL signal retention ≥70%（假设 3）成立的核心原因：GRPO 优化的是 reward signal（正确率/格式），\n511\t    而非 item-level response distribution。SFT memorization 写入的是 \"看到 item X → 输出 answer\n512\t    Y\" 的 pattern，这是 parameter-level 的 association。GRPO 的 policy gradient 更新主要影响 reasoning\n513\t    chain 的 token distribution，而 binary correctness 层面的 memorization 痕迹 （hard item\n514\t    仍然答对）大部分保留。signal 从 3.5 降到 2.8（retention=80%）的 20% 损失来自： (a) RL 训练中少量 seen items\n515\t    的 memorization 被 \"覆盖\"（RL 发现了不同的 reasoning path）， (b) RL 普遍提升了 unseen items 的正确率（θ进一步上升），轻微压缩了\n516\t    seen/unseen gap。 但关键是 binary response 层面的 aberrant pattern 仍然存在——模型在 \"不该答对\" 的\n517\t    hard items 上 仍然答对，这个 pattern-level signal 是 RL 无法消除的，因为 RL 没有动机去 \"故意答错\" 已经答对的题。\n518\t    相比之下，MIA methods（Min-K%++, PPL）失效是因为 RL 彻底重塑了 token-level distribution—— reasoning\n519\t    tokens 的 perplexity 分布被 GRPO 重新优化，训练数据的 token-level fingerprint 消失。 这是 binary\n520\t    vs token-level detection 的 structural advantage。\n521\t\n522\t    '\n523\t  tables:\n524\t  - name: 'Table: Pre-RL vs Post-RL Detection Comparison'\n525\t    columns:\n526\t    - method\n527\t    - info_level\n528\t    - auroc_pre_rl\n529\t    - auroc_post_rl\n530\t    - retention_pct\n531\t    rows:\n532\t    - - lz*_θ-fixed\n533\t      - binary\n534\t      - 0.92\n535\t      - 0.85\n536\t      - 80%\n537\t    - - Min-K%++\n538\t      - token_probs\n539\t      - 0.89\n540\t      - 0.54\n541\t      - 4%\n542\t    - - PPL-based\n543\t      - log_probs\n544\t      - 0.86\n545\t      - 0.52\n546\t      - 2%\n547\t    - - Acc z-score\n548\t      - binary\n549\t      - 0.71\n550\t      - 0.65\n551\t      - 60%\n552\t    - - LR (oracle)\n553\t      - binary\n554\t      - 0.84\n555\t      - 0.72\n556\t      - 56%\n557\t  - name: 'Table: Binary Response Patterns Pre/Post RL'\n558\t    columns:\n559\t    - metric\n560\t    - pre_rl\n561\t    - post_rl\n562\t    - change\n563\t    rows:\n564\t    - - Δlz*_fixed\n565\t      - 3.5\n566\t      - 2.8\n567\t      - -20%\n568\t    - - Cohen's d\n569\t      - -3.95\n570\t      - -3.15\n571\t      - -20%\n572\t    - - Seen accuracy\n573\t      - 0.86\n574\t      - 0.82\n575\t      - -4pp\n576\t    - - Unseen accuracy\n577\t      - 0.73\n578\t      - 0.76\n579\t      - +3pp\n580\t    - - Memorization fraction\n581\t      - 0.42\n582\t      - 0.34\n583\t      - -8pp\n584\t  figures_description:\n585\t  - 'Fig: Side-by-side lz* distributions (pre-RL vs post-RL) showing signal compression\n586\t    but retention'\n587\t  - 'Fig: Method comparison bar chart — AUROC pre/post RL for all methods, showing\n588\t    MIA collapse vs lz* retention'\n589\t  - 'Fig: Item-level analysis — scatter plot of P(correct) change per item, colored\n590\t    by seen/unseen'\n591\t  analysis: '这是论文最强的 selling point 之一。Wang et al. (2025) 证明所有 10 种 log-prob based\n592\t    methods 在 RL 后降至 random，而 lz* 保留 80% 信号。这直接证明了 minimal-information operating point\n593\t    的 structural advantage：binary patterns 对 RL 是 robust 的，因为 RL 优化的是 generation quality\n594\t    而非 item-level correctness erasure。paper 可以引用此结果 直接回应 Wang et al. 的 \"all methods\n595\t    fail\" claim——\"all TOKEN-LEVEL methods fail, but BINARY-LEVEL detection survives.\"\n596\t\n597\t    '\n598\t- name: Multiscale lzm Statistic\n599\t  plan_id: exp-multiscale-lzm\n600\t  description: '实现 Hong, Lin & Cheng (2021) 的 multiscale lzm——跨 benchmark 聚合的标准化 lz*\n601\t    总分。 在 PSN-IRT 12 模型和 ctrl-contam 模型上验证。\n602\t\n603\t    '\n604\t  expected_results:\n605\t    gemini15_lzm: 42.8\n606\t    deepseek_v3_lzm: 38.2\n607\t    yi_lightning_lzm: 35.6\n608\t    qwen_plus_lzm: 33.1\n609\t    doubao_pro_lzm: -8.4\n610\t    mistral_7b_lzm: 2.1\n611\t    lzm_vs_mean_lz_correlation: 0.97\n612\t    lzm_flagged_at_alpha005: 11/12\n613\t    ctrl_contam_lzm_clean: 8.5\n614\t    ctrl_contam_lzm_15pct: 14.2\n615\t    ctrl_contam_lzm_50pct: 22.8\n616\t    lzm_cohens_d_15pct: -4.12\n617\t    lzm_incremental_over_single_benchmark: +0.15 AUROC vs single-best benchmark\n618\t  result_rationale: 'lzm 聚合跨 benchmark 信号的原理：如果一个模型在多个 benchmarks 上都表现异常， lzm 将这些独立\n619\t    signals 标准化后求和，产生比任何单一 benchmark 更强的检测统计量。 在 best 档下，ctrl-contam 跨 3 个 benchmarks\n620\t    都注入了污染，lzm 的 multi-benchmark aggregation 产生额外的 +0.15 AUROC 增益。对 PSN-IRT 12 模型，lzm\n621\t    与 mean_lz* 高度相关（r=0.97） 因为大多数模型的 anomaly 在所有 benchmarks 上方向一致（positive direction\n622\t    dominant, 93.3% cells）。 Doubao-pro 的负 lzm 反映其独特的 negative lz* 模式（STEM 和 Humanities\n623\t    domains 特异性不足）。 这是一个 methodological addition（不是核心贡献），但增强了 paper 的 completeness。\n624\t\n625\t    '\n626\t  tables:\n627\t  - name: 'Table: lzm Scores for PSN-IRT 12 Models'\n628\t    columns:\n629\t    - model\n630\t    - lz_mmlu\n631\t    - lz_hellaswag\n632\t    - lz_gsm8k\n633\t    - lz_arc_c\n634\t    - lz_humaneval\n635\t    - lzm_aggregate\n636\t    rows:\n637\t    - - Gemini-1.5\n638\t      - 31.8\n639\t      - 28.4\n640\t      - 12.1\n641\t      - 6.2\n642\t      - -2.4\n643\t      - 42.8\n644\t    - - DeepSeek-V3\n645\t      - 28.6\n646\t      - 25.1\n647\t      - 10.8\n648\t      - 5.8\n649\t      - -1.2\n650\t      - 38.2\n651\t    - - Yi-Lightning\n652\t      - 26.4\n653\t      - 22.3\n654\t      - 9.5\n655\t      - -0.3\n656\t      - -1.8\n657\t      - 35.6\n658\t    - - Doubao-Pro\n659\t      - -12.5\n660\t      - -8.2\n661\t      - 4.3\n662\t      - -2.1\n663\t      - -3.8\n664\t      - -8.4\n665\t  figures_description:\n666\t  - 'Fig: lzm bar chart for 12 models, sorted by magnitude, with 95% CI error bars'\n667\t  - 'Fig: lzm vs mean(lz*) scatter showing near-perfect correlation but information-theoretic\n668\t    gain from proper weighting'\n669\t  analysis: 'lzm 提供了一个 principled 的跨 benchmark 聚合方式，比简单 mean(lz*) 有理论优势 （proper variance\n670\t    weighting）。在 ctrl-contam 中，multi-benchmark contamination 的 lzm 检测力比 single-best\n671\t    benchmark 强 0.15 AUROC，证明了 multiscale 方法的实用价值。 但核心贡献仍是 per-benchmark lz*，lzm 作为\n672\t    extension/robustness check。\n673\t\n674\t    '\n675\t- name: Extra Benchmarks (BBH + MATH)\n676\t  plan_id: exp-extra-benchmarks\n677\t  description: 'BBH (6,511 items) 和 MATH (5,000 items) 扩展，填充 1K-10K items 的 power\n678\t    gap。 在 ctrl-contam 模型上验证中等规模 benchmark 的检测力。\n679\t\n680\t    '\n681\t  expected_results:\n682\t    bbh_theoretical_power_15pct: 0.88\n683\t    math_theoretical_power_15pct: 0.82\n684\t    bbh_actual_power_15pct: 0.85\n685\t    math_actual_power_15pct: 0.78\n686\t    bbh_cohens_d_15pct: -3.21\n687\t    math_cohens_d_15pct: -2.88\n688\t    bbh_memorization_fraction: 0.4\n689\t    math_memorization_fraction: 0.36\n690\t    R2_with_new_benchmarks: 0.968\n691\t    bbh_dose_response_monotonic_theta_fixed: true\n692\t    math_dose_response_monotonic_theta_fixed: true\n693\t    bbh_theta_fixed_ratio: 2.72\n694\t    math_theta_fixed_ratio: 2.58\n695\t  result_rationale: 'BBH（6511 items）和 MATH（5000 items）填充了 GSM8K（1319）和 MMLU（14042）之间的\n696\t    gap。 在 best 档下，两者都产生显著检测信号：BBH 因为 items 多且区分度高（BIG-Bench Hard 的 items 被设计为 challenging），theoretical\n697\t    power 接近 90%；MATH 的 items 更结构化（数学题）， memorization fraction 稍低（0.36 vs 0.40）因为数学题的\n698\t    SFT 更容易产生 generalization 而非 verbatim memorization。两者的加入使 power function 的 R² 从\n699\t    0.957 提升到 0.968， 进一步验证了 Claim 2 的 power ∝ f(n_items) 关系。这些中等规模 benchmarks 是实际应用中最常见的尺寸范围（多数\n700\t    benchmarks 在 1K-10K 之间），因此验证至关重要。\n701\t\n702\t    '\n703\t  tables:\n704\t  - name: 'Table: Extended Power Function Validation'\n705\t    columns:\n706\t    - benchmark\n707\t    - n_items\n708\t    - theoretical_power_15pct\n709\t    - actual_power_ctrl\n710\t    - cohens_d_15pct\n711\t    rows:\n712\t    - - MMLU\n713\t      - 14042\n714\t      - 0.985\n715\t      - 0.92\n716\t      - -3.95\n717\t    - - HellaSwag\n718\t      - 10042\n719\t      - 0.753\n720\t      - 0.71\n721\t      - -2.64\n722\t    - - BBH\n723\t      - 6511\n724\t      - 0.88\n725\t      - 0.85\n726\t      - -3.21\n727\t    - - MATH\n728\t      - 5000\n729\t      - 0.82\n730\t      - 0.78\n731\t      - -2.88\n732\t    - - GSM8K\n733\t      - 1319\n734\t      - 0.59\n735\t      - 0.55\n736\t      - -1.42\n737\t  figures_description:\n738\t  - 'Fig: Updated power function curve with 5 benchmark points (adding BBH, MATH),\n739\t    showing improved R²=0.968 fit'\n740\t  - 'Fig: Detection signal (|Cohen''s d|) vs n_items scatter plot, confirming monotonic\n741\t    relationship'\n742\t  analysis: 'BBH 和 MATH 的加入完善了 power function 的中间区段验证。5 个 benchmarks 覆盖了 1.3K 到 14K\n743\t    items 的完整范围，R²=0.968 确认 power 与 √n 的理论关系在实际 ctrl-contam 中成立。 这直接支撑 Claim 2 的核心论断：detection\n744\t    power is a predictable function of benchmark size。\n745\t\n746\t    '\n747\t- name: Natural Experiment (base→chat pairs)\n748\t  plan_id: exp-natural-experiment\n749\t  description: 'v1 leaderboard base→chat model pairs 计算 Δlz* = lz*(chat) - lz*(base)\n750\t    作为 SFT 效应代理。\n751\t\n752\t    '\n753\t  expected_results:\n754\t    n_pairs: 21\n755\t    n_complete_pairs: 9\n756\t    hellaswag_systematic_effect:\n757\t      mean_deviation: -3.8\n758\t      t_stat: -4.2\n759\t      p_value: 0.0008\n760\t      direction: SFT decreases person-fit\n761\t    gsm8k_systematic_effect:\n762\t      mean_deviation: 4.5\n763\t      t_stat: 3.8\n764\t      p_value: 0.004\n765\t      direction: SFT increases person-fit\n766\t    mmlu_effect:\n767\t      p_value: 0.12\n768\t      direction: non-significant\n769\t    arc_c_effect:\n770\t      p_value: 0.31\n771\t      direction: non-significant\n772\t    individual_outlier_pairs: 1\n773\t    outlier_model: codellama-34b-instruct\n774\t    outlier_benchmark: GSM8K\n775\t    outlier_delta_lz: 8.7\n776\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 natural experiment 的结果比 registry 中的实际结果稍强：HellaSwag 和\n777\t    GSM8K 显示更清晰的 systematic SFT effect（p<0.001 和 p<0.005），且出现一个 individual outlier\n778\t    （codellama-34b-instruct 在 GSM8K 上 Δlz*=8.7，远超 group mean）。这个 outlier 的出现是 best\n779\t    档独有的——它提供了 \"自然实验中发现疑似污染\" 的 case study evidence。 HellaSwag 的 negative shift 解释：chat\n780\t    SFT 训练中包含了对话/常识推理数据， 这些与 HellaSwag 的 commonsense completion task 有 domain overlap，导致泛化性提升\n781\t    但 pattern 变得 less aberrant（更符合 IRT 预测）。GSM8K positive shift： chat 模型的 math instruction\n782\t    tuning 不是 benchmark-specific memorization 而是 reasoning capability，但少数模型可能直接接触了\n783\t    GSM8K items。 由于 a_r=0.111 的 discrimination failure，此实验只能作为 converging evidence，不是\n784\t    primary claim。\n785\t\n786\t    '\n787\t  tables:\n788\t  - name: 'Table: Systematic SFT Effects on lz* (base→chat)'\n789\t    columns:\n790\t    - benchmark\n791\t    - n_pairs\n792\t    - mean_Δlz\n793\t    - t_stat\n794\t    - p_value\n795\t    - interpretation\n796\t    rows:\n797\t    - - HellaSwag\n798\t      - 9\n799\t      - -3.8\n800\t      - -4.2\n801\t      - 0.0008\n802\t      - SFT improves commonsense (less aberrant)\n803\t    - - GSM8K\n804\t      - 9\n805\t      - 4.5\n806\t      - 3.8\n807\t      - 0.004\n808\t      - Math SFT creates new aberrance patterns\n809\t    - - MMLU\n810\t      - 9\n811\t      - 1.8\n812\t      - 1.7\n813\t      - 0.12\n814\t      - n.s.\n815\t    - - ARC-C\n816\t      - 9\n817\t      - 0.9\n818\t      - 1.1\n819\t      - 0.31\n820\t      - n.s.\n821\t  figures_description:\n822\t  - 'Fig: Paired Δlz* plot (base→chat) for each benchmark, with individual pair lines\n823\t    and group mean ± CI'\n824\t  analysis: 'P2-optional 实验。提供了 real-world SFT 效应的 converging evidence，但受限于 a_r=0.111\n825\t    的 discrimination failure。在 paper 中作为 supplementary finding 而非 primary evidence。\n826\t\n827\t    '\n828\t- name: V1 IRT Refit Expanded (N=178)\n829\t  plan_id: exp-v1-irt-refit-expanded\n830\t  description: '扩大 v1 IRT 重拟合样本量至 N≥178，最终验证 Path D（large-scale audit）是否可行。\n831\t\n832\t    '\n833\t  expected_results:\n834\t    n_models: 178\n835\t    n_items: 14042\n836\t    3pl_a_pearson_r: 0.13\n837\t    2pl_a_pearson_r: -0.03\n838\t    3pl_b_pearson_r: 0.66\n839\t    a_r_below_threshold: true\n840\t    conclusion: Path D confirmed dead. Classical MML-EM cannot recover IRT discrimination\n841\t      from LLM response data at available sample sizes.\n842\t  result_rationale: '即使在 best 档，Path D（leaderboard-scale audit via classical IRT refit）仍然失败。\n843\t    这不是 experiment failure 而是 honest negative result：classical IRT estimation 需要 hundreds\n844\t    of examinees with similar ability distributions，而 LLM response data 的特殊性（模型间 ability\n845\t    range 极大，item response 非 locally independent） 使得 MML-EM 无法恢复 discrimination parameters。a_r=0.13\n846\t    << 0.4 threshold 确认 discriminability failure 不是样本量问题而是 structural incompatibility。\n847\t    这本身是 Claim 3(c) 的贡献：quantifying the estimation challenge for neural IRT。\n848\t\n849\t    '\n850\t  tables:\n851\t  - name: 'Table: IRT Parameter Recovery (Classical vs PSN-IRT)'\n852\t    columns:\n853\t    - method\n854\t    - N_models\n855\t    - a_pearson_r\n856\t    - b_pearson_r\n857\t    - conclusion\n858\t    rows:\n859\t    - - MML-EM 3PL (N=63)\n860\t      - 63\n861\t      - 0.111\n862\t      - 0.626\n863\t      - a failure\n864\t    - - MML-EM 3PL (N=178)\n865\t      - 178\n866\t      - 0.13\n867\t      - 0.66\n868\t      - a failure persists\n869\t    - - PSN-IRT (neural)\n870\t      - 12\n871\t      - validated\n872\t      - validated\n873\t      - reference standard\n874\t  figures_description:\n875\t  - 'Fig: Scatter plot of MML-EM a_hat vs PSN-IRT a_true for N=178, showing near-zero\n876\t    correlation'\n877\t  analysis: 'Path D 的确定性关闭是 paper structure 的关键节点。它确立了 \"why ctrl-contam, not leaderboard\n878\t    audit\" 的 methodological justification，并为 Future Work 中的 \"neural IRT at scale\"\n879\t    提供了动机。\n880\t\n881\t    '\n882\t- name: 4PL vs 3PL Ablation\n883\t  plan_id: exp-4pl-ablation\n884\t  description: '4PL vs 3PL(d=1) 消融实验：量化 d 参数对检测灵敏度的影响。\n885\t\n886\t    '\n887\t  expected_results:\n888\t    mean_power_gain_4pl_vs_3pl:\n889\t      MMLU: +28pp\n890\t      HellaSwag: +27pp\n891\t      GSM8K: +21pp\n892\t      ARC_C: +15pp\n893\t      HumanEval: +14pp\n894\t    far_4pl: 0.05\n895\t    far_3pl: 0.05-0.17 (inflated)\n896\t    far_2pl: 0.50-1.00 (catastrophic)\n897\t    items_with_d_lt_095_mmlu: 46%\n898\t    ctrl_contam_4pl_d_15pct: -3.95\n899\t    ctrl_contam_3pl_d_15pct: -1.82\n900\t    power_loss_without_d: 54%\n901\t  result_rationale: '4PL 的 d 参数（upper asymptote）对高能力 LLM 至关重要：当 d<1 时，P(correct) 的上限低于\n902\t    1.0， 高能力模型在这些 items 上 \"应该\" 答错（按 4PL 预测）。如果忽略 d（设 d=1）， model 预测所有高能力模型都应该答对所有题——这会让\n903\t    few errors 变成 extreme aberrance（false alarm）。 MMLU 46% items 有 d<0.95 意味着将近一半的题目有上限效应，忽略这些会产生巨大的\n904\t    FAR 膨胀。 在 best 档下，ctrl-contam 进一步确认：同一污染实验用 3PL 分析时 |d| 从 3.95 降到 1.82， 因为 3PL\n905\t    的 inflated null variance 稀释了真实信号。这证明 4PL 不是 \"nice-to-have\" 而是 LLM person-fit 分析的\n906\t    necessary condition。\n907\t\n908\t    '\n909\t  tables:\n910\t  - name: 'Table: 4PL vs 3PL Detection Performance'\n911\t    columns:\n912\t    - benchmark\n913\t    - n_items\n914\t    - power_4pl_25pct\n915\t    - power_3pl_25pct\n916\t    - gain\n917\t    - pct_items_d_lt_095\n918\t    rows:\n919\t    - - MMLU\n920\t      - 14042\n921\t      - 0.776\n922\t      - 0.329\n923\t      - +44.7pp\n924\t      - 46%\n925\t    - - HellaSwag\n926\t      - 10042\n927\t      - 0.534\n928\t      - 0.28\n929\t      - +25.4pp\n930\t      - 38%\n931\t    - - GSM8K\n932\t      - 1319\n933\t      - 0.73\n934\t      - 0.334\n935\t      - +39.6pp\n936\t      - 42%\n937\t    - - ARC-C\n938\t      - 295\n939\t      - 0.132\n940\t      - 0.091\n941\t      - +4.1pp\n942\t      - 29%\n943\t    - - HumanEval\n944\t      - 164\n945\t      - 0.318\n946\t      - 0.165\n947\t      - +15.3pp\n948\t      - 35%\n949\t  figures_description:\n950\t  - 'Fig: Power comparison curves (4PL solid, 3PL dashed) across contamination levels\n951\t    for each benchmark'\n952\t  - 'Fig: Item-level analysis — d parameter distribution histogram with 0.95 threshold\n953\t    marked'\n954\t  analysis: '4PL ablation 是 methodological rigor 的体现。Reviewer 可能质疑 \"为什么不用更简单的 3PL\"，\n955\t    此实验给出定量答案：+28pp average power gain，54% signal loss without d。 结合 exp-4pl-real-data-degradation（r=0.225\n956\t    between 4PL/3PL lz*）， establishes 4PL 作为 LLM person-fit 的 minimum viable parameterization。\n957\t\n958\t    '\n959\t- name: Baseline Comparison — Accuracy Z-Score (completed)\n960\t  plan_id: exp-baseline-comparison\n961\t  description: 'Accuracy z-score 作为 same-level binary-only baseline 的扩展对比， 整合入完整 baseline\n962\t    comparison 实验中。\n963\t\n964\t    '\n965\t  expected_results:\n966\t    acc_zscore_auroc_5pct: 0.55\n967\t    acc_zscore_auroc_10pct: 0.63\n968\t    acc_zscore_auroc_15pct: 0.71\n969\t    acc_zscore_auroc_25pct: 0.78\n970\t    lz_star_advantage_over_zscore_5pct: +0.23 AUROC\n971\t    lz_star_advantage_over_zscore_15pct: +0.21 AUROC\n972\t    lz_star_advantage_over_zscore_25pct: +0.16 AUROC\n973\t  result_rationale: 'Accuracy z-score 只利用 total score（sum of binary responses）而丢失所有\n974\t    item-level pattern information。lz* 的优势正来自于 item-level aberrance detection： 它区分\n975\t    \"总分高因为答对了该对的题\" vs \"总分高因为答对了不该对的题\"。 在 5% 低污染时，只有 ~700 items（14042×5%）被 contaminate，total\n976\t    score change 微乎其微 （+2-3 pp accuracy），z-score 几乎无法检测。但 lz* 能捕捉到这 700 items 中的 \"不可能正确\"\n977\t    模式。 这是 \"IRT structure as inductive bias\" 的最直接证明。\n978\t\n979\t    '\n980\t  tables: []\n981\t  figures_description:\n982\t  - 'Fig: lz* vs accuracy z-score ROC curves at 5% and 15% contamination, showing\n983\t    consistent lz* advantage'\n984\t  analysis: 'Accuracy z-score 是 \"straw-man\" 但也是 fair comparison：它是唯一的 same-information-level\n985\t    baseline （binary only, no training data）。lz* 的 consistent +0.16-0.23 AUROC advantage\n986\t    直接证明 IRT item parameters 提供了有价值的 structural information。\n987\t\n988\t    '\n989\t- name: Domain-Level Analysis\n990\t  plan_id: exp-domain-analysis\n991\t  description: 'MMLU domain-level 分析：按 subject category 分别计算 person-fit，识别污染的 domain\n992\t    分布。\n993\t\n994\t    '\n995\t  expected_results:\n996\t    gemini_subjects_flagged: 50/57 (87.7%)\n997\t    gemini_contamination_uniform: true\n998\t    gemini_category_lz_range:\n999\t    - 15.3\n1000\t    - 21.2\n1001\t    ctrl_contam_domain_uniformity: uniform (as expected, since QLoRA trains on random\n1002\t      15% sample)\n1003\t    ctrl_contam_stem_lz: 3.8\n1004\t    ctrl_contam_humanities_lz: 3.3\n1005\t    ctrl_contam_social_sci_lz: 3.5\n1006\t    ctrl_contam_other_lz: 3.2\n1007\t    doubao_selective_domains: true\n1008\t    doubao_negative_pattern: STEM and Humanities strongly negative, Other positive\n1009\t  result_rationale: 'Domain analysis 在 best 档下产生两个 clear findings：(1) Gemini-1.5 的\n1010\t    contamination 是 uniform across domains（所有 subject 都被 memorize），consistent with\n1011\t    \"bulk training data leak\" 而非 \"selective domain tuning\"；(2) ctrl-contam 模型的 domain-level\n1012\t    signal 也是 uniform （因为 QLoRA 训练样本是 randomly sampled across all subjects），验证了实验设计的\n1013\t    internal consistency。 Doubao 的 selective negative pattern 则展示了不同类型的 anomaly：可能是\n1014\t    domain-specific training data 导致某些 domains 泛化过强（lz*<0 = over-consistent pattern）。\n1015\t\n1016\t    '\n1017\t  tables:\n1018\t  - name: 'Table: MMLU Domain-Level lz* (Gemini-1.5 vs Ctrl-Contam)'\n1019\t    columns:\n1020\t    - domain\n1021\t    - gemini_lz\n1022\t    - ctrl_contam_15_lz\n1023\t    - ctrl_contam_clean_lz\n1024\t    rows:\n1025\t    - - STEM\n1026\t      - 21.2\n1027\t      - 3.8\n1028\t      - 0.1\n1029\t    - - Humanities\n1030\t      - 17.9\n1031\t      - 3.3\n1032\t      - -0.2\n1033\t    - - Social Sciences\n1034\t      - 15.9\n1035\t      - 3.5\n1036\t      - 0.0\n1037\t    - - Other\n1038\t      - 15.3\n1039\t      - 3.2\n1040\t      - 0.1\n1041\t  figures_description:\n1042\t  - 'Fig: Heatmap of domain-level lz* across models (rows=models, cols=57 MMLU subjects),\n1043\t    color=lz*'\n1044\t  - 'Fig: Ctrl-contam domain uniformity test — bar chart showing no significant domain\n1045\t    variation (χ² test)'\n1046\t  analysis: 'Domain analysis 提供了 contamination 的 \"spatial resolution\"：从 aggregate\n1047\t    model-level detection 到 domain-level localization。在 paper 中服务于两个目的：(a) 验证 ctrl-contam\n1048\t    内部一致性 （random sampling → uniform signal），(b) case study 中展示不同 contamination type\n1049\t    的 domain fingerprint。\n1050\t\n1051\t    '\n1052\t- name: Leaderboard Audit (Abandoned)\n1053\t  plan_id: exp-leaderboard-audit\n1054\t  description: 'Open LLM Leaderboard v1 大规模 13K+ 模型扫描。因 IRT refit failure 放弃。\n1055\t\n1056\t    '\n1057\t  expected_results:\n1058\t    status: ABANDONED\n1059\t    reason: a_r=0.111 discrimination failure makes lz* degenerate to accuracy-like\n1060\t      metric at scale\n1061\t    paper_treatment: Data availability noted in Discussion/Future Work; 13K+ per-item\n1062\t      data available for future neural IRT estimation\n1063\t  result_rationale: '即使在 best 档，leaderboard audit 仍然 abandoned。这不影响 best 档的叙事， 因为\n1064\t    ctrl-contam 提供了比 leaderboard audit 更强的 ground-truth validation。 Audit 的 abandonment\n1065\t    本身是 honest negative result (Claim 3c)：classical IRT 的 sample size requirement\n1066\t    与 LLM evaluation ecosystem 不兼容。 Paper 中将其定位为 \"future work when neural IRT estimation\n1067\t    at scale becomes feasible\"。\n1068\t\n1069\t    '\n1070\t  tables: []\n1071\t  figures_description: []\n1072\t  analysis: ABANDONED。在 paper 中转化为 methodological contribution：量化了 classical vs neural\n1073\t    IRT 在 LLM context 中的 gap，为 future work 提供了 concrete roadmap（13K+ data available,\n1074\t    awaiting better estimation methods）。\n1075\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"95beeaab-bb88-4eb2-a0bf-c2e8f7ef96cd","uuid":"80193d66-2a70-4e6b-af56-b8db9312f04d","timestamp":"2026-05-20T19:37:20.018Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0519-3/projects/irt_personfit_contam/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260520T190245/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立。IRT-FIT 是 minimal-information operating point\n  上的有效检测框架： 跨 4 个模型家族一致检测、post-RL robust、在实际关键的低污染率下无需标注数据即胜过 supervised baselines。\n  三条 claims 无需调整——Claim 1 的 \"principled framework\" 有 ctrl-contam 全面验证， Claim 2 的 power\n  function 有 multi-benchmark 实证确认，Claim 3 的 empirical findings 加入 ctrl-contam 的跨模型\n  memorization 量化。θ-shift 作为 methodological contribution 而非 limitation。 Headline:\n  \"binary response patterns alone detect SFT contamination across model families,\n  even after RL post-training.\"\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Controlled Contamination Pilot (Qwen3.5-9B)\n  plan_id: exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\n  description: 'Qwen3.5-9B × 4 conditions (0%-seed1/0%-seed2/15%/50%) × MMLU。 验证 Δlz*\n    显著性、clean-vs-clean noise floor、seen/unseen memorization fraction。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    clean_s1_lz_star: 7.2\n    clean_s2_lz_star: 6.8\n    clean_delta_lz: 0.4\n    clean_delta_nonsig: true\n    contam_15_lz_star_free: 2.8\n    contam_15_delta_lz_free: -4.1\n    contam_15_cohens_d: -3.95\n    contam_50_lz_star_free: 4.9\n    contam_50_delta_lz_free: -2.0\n    contam_15_lz_star_fixed: 10.5\n    contam_50_lz_star_fixed: 16.8\n    theta_fixed_delta_15: 3.5\n    theta_fixed_delta_50: 9.8\n    theta_fixed_ratio: 2.8\n    accuracy_clean: 0.71\n    accuracy_contam_15: 0.76\n    accuracy_contam_50: 0.8\n    accuracy_contam_15_seen: 0.86\n    accuracy_contam_15_unseen: 0.73\n    memorization_fraction_15: 0.42\n    memorization_fraction_50: 0.31\n    theta_shift_clean: -0.08\n    theta_shift_contam_15: 0.22\n    theta_shift_contam_50: 0.41\n  result_rationale: 'Qwen3.5-9B 作为较新架构（含 thinking 能力），SFT memorization 效率略高于 Qwen2.5-7B。\n    15% 污染产生强信号（|d|≈4.0）是因为 QLoRA 在小比例 seen items 上产生明确的 aberrant pattern： 模型在高难度\n    seen items 上异常正确，而在 unseen items 上保持原有错误模式。memorization_fraction≈0.42 说明 ~42%\n    的 seen items 被完全记忆（产生 aberrant response），剩余 58% 产生了泛化而非逐字记忆。 θ-shift 机制与 pilot\n    一致：污染提升整体能力估计，θ_MLE 上升吸收了部分 aberrance signal， θ-fixed 恢复单调性。clean-vs-clean Δ≈0.4\n    确认 noise floor 远低于检测阈值。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Qwen3.5-9B Pilot Results'\n    columns:\n    - condition\n    - accuracy\n    - lz_star_free\n    - lz_star_fixed\n    - theta_MLE\n    - delta_lz_free\n    - delta_lz_fixed\n    rows:\n    - - clean_s1\n      - 0.71\n      - 7.2\n      - 7.2\n      - -0.08\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - clean_s2\n      - 0.71\n      - 6.8\n      - 6.8\n      - -0.09\n      - 0.4\n      - 0.4\n    - - contam_15\n      - 0.76\n      - 2.8\n      - 10.5\n      - 0.22\n      - -4.1\n      - 3.5\n    - - contam_50\n      - 0.8\n      - 4.9\n      - 16.8\n      - 0.41\n      - -2.0\n      - 9.8\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: θ-shift diagram showing clean θ≈-0.08, contam_15 θ=0.22, contam_50 θ=0.41;\n    arrows indicate signal absorption mechanism'\n  - 'Fig: Seen vs unseen accuracy split bar chart (contam_15: 0.86 vs 0.73; contam_50:\n    0.80 vs 0.72)'\n  analysis: 'Go/no-go 信号明确通过。|d|=3.95 远超 0.8 的 large effect 阈值。θ-fixed 恢复单调 dose-response\n    (ratio=2.80∈[2.5,4.0])，确认 θ-shift 是唯一导致 free-θ 非单调的机制。 memorization_fraction=0.42\n    意味着理论 power 的 ~42% 可在实际中实现——MMLU 15% 理论 power 98.5% × 0.42 = adjusted power ≈41%，但\n    lz* 检测的是 aggregate pattern 而非逐 item 检测， 所以 aggregate Δlz* 仍然产生 |d|≈4 的强效应。\n\n    '\n- name: Full Multi-Model Controlled Contamination\n  plan_id: exp-ctrl-contam\n  description: '4 模型 (Qwen3.5-9B, Gemma-4-31B, Llama-3.1-8B, Mistral-7B-v0.3) × 6\n    contamination levels (0/5/10/15/25/50%) × 3 benchmarks (MMLU, GSM8K, HellaSwag)。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    cohens_d_15pct_mmlu:\n      qwen3.5-9b: -3.95\n      gemma-4-31b: -4.52\n      llama-3.1-8b: -2.85\n      mistral-7b-v0.3: -2.42\n    cohens_d_15pct_mean: 3.44\n    cohens_d_15pct_min: 2.42\n    models_significant_at_15pct: 4\n    benchmarks_significant_per_model:\n      qwen3.5-9b: 3\n      gemma-4-31b: 3\n      llama-3.1-8b: 2\n      mistral-7b-v0.3: 2\n    gsm8k_cohens_d_15pct:\n      qwen3.5-9b: -1.42\n      gemma-4-31b: -1.68\n      llama-3.1-8b: -0.91\n      mistral-7b-v0.3: -0.85\n    gsm8k_all_above_0.8: true\n    memorization_fraction_15pct:\n      qwen3.5-9b: 0.42\n      gemma-4-31b: 0.48\n      llama-3.1-8b: 0.35\n      mistral-7b-v0.3: 0.33\n    memorization_fraction_mean: 0.4\n    theta_fixed_dose_response_ratio:\n      qwen3.5-9b: 2.8\n      gemma-4-31b: 3.45\n      llama-3.1-8b: 2.62\n      mistral-7b-v0.3: 2.55\n    theta_fixed_ratio_mean: 2.86\n    theta_fixed_all_monotonic: true\n    seen_unseen_lz_gap_15pct:\n      qwen3.5-9b: 3.2\n      gemma-4-31b: 4.1\n      llama-3.1-8b: 2.7\n      mistral-7b-v0.3: 2.5\n    seen_unseen_gap_mean: 3.13\n    dose_response_mmlu_theta_fixed:\n      5pct:\n        qwen: 1.1\n        gemma: 1.4\n        llama: 0.8\n        mistral: 0.7\n      10pct:\n        qwen: 2.2\n        gemma: 2.7\n        llama: 1.6\n        mistral: 1.4\n      15pct:\n        qwen: 3.5\n        gemma: 4.2\n        llama: 2.5\n        mistral: 2.2\n      25pct:\n        qwen: 5.8\n        gemma: 7.0\n        llama: 4.1\n        mistral: 3.7\n      50pct:\n        qwen: 9.8\n        gemma: 14.5\n        llama: 6.6\n        mistral: 6.3\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档要求 4/4 模型在 15% 均显著。Gemma-4-31B 作为 31B 参数模型具有更强的 memorization\n    能力 （SFT 时容量更大，更容易逐字存储 seen items），因此 |d| 最高（4.52）且 memorization_fraction 最高（0.48）。Llama-3.1-8B\n    和 Mistral-7B-v0.3 参数较少但仍在 |d|>2.0 范围，因为 QLoRA 即使在小模型上也能有效注入 memorization——关键是\n    LoRA rank 足够捕获 item-level patterns。 GSM8K 虽然只有 ~1.3K items（理论 power 较低），但 ctrl-contam\n    测量的是 Δlz*（within-model shift） 而非绝对检测，所以即使 power function 预测 single-model detection\n    只有 59%， paired comparison 的效应量仍可达 |d|>0.8。θ-fixed 策略在所有模型上普适是因为 θ-shift 机制是 IRT\n    MLE 估计的数学性质（污染→更多正确→θ_MLE↑），与模型架构无关。 Seen/unseen gap∈[2.5,5.0] 反映了 SFT 的部分泛化效应：seen\n    items lz*≈0（memorized items 看起来\"正常\"），unseen items lz* 保持高值（未被 memorize 的 items\n    仍然产生 aberrant patterns）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cross-Model Detection at 15% Contamination (MMLU)'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - accuracy_clean\n    - accuracy_contam15\n    - delta_lz_free\n    - delta_lz_fixed\n    - cohens_d\n    - memorization_frac\n    - theta_shift\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3.5-9B\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.76\n      - -4.1\n      - 3.5\n      - -3.95\n      - 0.42\n      - 0.3\n    - - Gemma-4-31B\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.84\n      - -4.8\n      - 4.2\n      - -4.52\n      - 0.48\n      - 0.35\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - 0.63\n      - 0.69\n      - -2.9\n      - 2.5\n      - -2.85\n      - 0.35\n      - 0.24\n    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n      - 0.61\n      - 0.67\n      - -2.5\n      - 2.2\n      - -2.42\n      - 0.33\n      - 0.21\n  - name: 'Table: GSM8K Small-Benchmark Detection at 15%'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - n_items\n    - delta_lz_fixed\n    - cohens_d\n    - significant_p005\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3.5-9B\n      - 1319\n      - 1.8\n      - -1.42\n      - true\n    - - Gemma-4-31B\n      - 1319\n      - 2.1\n      - -1.68\n      - true\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - 1319\n      - 1.2\n      - -0.91\n      - true\n    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n      - 1319\n      - 1.1\n      - -0.85\n      - true\n  - name: 'Table: θ-Fixed Dose-Response (MMLU, all models)'\n    columns:\n    - contam_level\n    - qwen_delta\n    - gemma_delta\n    - llama_delta\n    - mistral_delta\n    - monotonic\n    rows:\n    - - 5%\n      - 1.1\n      - 1.4\n      - 0.8\n      - 0.7\n      - ✓\n    - - 10%\n      - 2.2\n      - 2.7\n      - 1.6\n      - 1.4\n      - ✓\n    - - 15%\n      - 3.5\n      - 4.2\n      - 2.5\n      - 2.2\n      - ✓\n    - - 25%\n      - 5.8\n      - 7.0\n      - 4.1\n      - 3.7\n      - ✓\n    - - 50%\n      - 9.8\n      - 14.5\n      - 6.6\n      - 6.3\n      - ✓\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: 4-panel dose-response curves (one per model), x=contamination%, y=Δlz*_fixed,\n    all monotonically increasing'\n  - 'Fig: Cross-model Cohen''s d forest plot at 15% contamination, showing all 4 models\n    × 3 benchmarks with 95% bootstrap CIs'\n  - 'Fig: Seen/unseen lz* distribution violin plots per model at 15% contamination'\n  - 'Fig: Memorization fraction heat map (4 models × 3 benchmarks × 6 levels)'\n  analysis: '核心假设 1 完全验证：SFT memorization fingerprint 跨 4 个模型家族一致。效应量范围 [2.42, 4.52]\n    远超统计显著性需求。θ-fixed 策略普适性确认（假设 2），所有模型的 dose-response ratio ∈[2.55, 3.45]。 GSM8K\n    的小 benchmark 假设（假设 4）通过 |d|>0.8 验证，尽管绝对信号弱于 MMLU（n=14042 vs 1319）， paired comparison\n    设计弥补了 power 不足。这为 Claim 1 提供了跨架构、跨规模的 ground-truth validation。\n\n    '\n- name: Baseline Comparison (≥5 methods)\n  plan_id: exp-baseline-comparison\n  description: '在 ctrl-contam ground-truth 上比较 IRT-FIT vs 5+ baselines 的 AUROC。 Baselines:\n    ConStat (re-test), Min-K%++ (token probs), accuracy z-score, PPL-based detection,\n    random baseline, + ML classifiers (LR/RF)。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    auroc_5pct:\n      lz_star_theta_fixed: 0.78\n      lr_binary_oracle: 0.62\n      rf_binary_oracle: 0.59\n      accuracy_zscore: 0.55\n      min_k_pp: 0.71\n      ppl_based: 0.68\n      constat_retest: 0.65\n      random: 0.5\n    auroc_10pct:\n      lz_star_theta_fixed: 0.87\n      lr_binary_oracle: 0.74\n      rf_binary_oracle: 0.72\n      accuracy_zscore: 0.63\n      min_k_pp: 0.82\n      ppl_based: 0.79\n      constat_retest: 0.76\n      random: 0.5\n    auroc_15pct:\n      lz_star_theta_fixed: 0.92\n      lr_binary_oracle: 0.84\n      rf_binary_oracle: 0.82\n      accuracy_zscore: 0.71\n      min_k_pp: 0.89\n      ppl_based: 0.86\n      constat_retest: 0.83\n      random: 0.5\n    auroc_25pct:\n      lz_star_theta_fixed: 0.94\n      lr_binary_oracle: 0.92\n      rf_binary_oracle: 0.91\n      accuracy_zscore: 0.78\n      min_k_pp: 0.95\n      ppl_based: 0.93\n      constat_retest: 0.91\n      random: 0.5\n    lz_minus_best_baseline_5pct: 0.07\n    lz_minus_best_binary_baseline_5pct: 0.16\n    crossover_point: ~20% (Min-K%++ surpasses lz* above 20%)\n    bootstrap_ci_width_mean: 0.04\n    information_levels:\n      binary_only:\n      - lz_star\n      - accuracy_zscore\n      - lr_binary\n      - rf_binary\n      token_probs:\n      - min_k_pp\n      - ppl_based\n      retest_required:\n      - constat_retest\n  result_rationale: 'lz* 在 5-10% 低污染率胜出所有 baselines（假设 5）的机制：IRT 结构作为 inductive bias。\n    在低污染率下，signal-to-noise 极低——只有 5-10% 的 items 携带 contamination signal。 ML classifiers（LR/RF）即使有\n    oracle labels 也面临严重的 class imbalance（5% positive）， 且 binary feature space（0/1\n    per item）在低 contamination 时几乎不可分。 lz* 的优势来自 IRT model 提供的 structured expectation：它知道每个\n    item 的 expected P(correct|θ)， 因此即使只有 5% items 被 contaminate，这些 items 上的 \"impossible\n    correctness\"（高难度 item 被答对） 会被精确捕获为 aberrance。而 ML classifier 只看到 raw 0/1 pattern，缺乏\n    item difficulty 的先验。 Min-K%++ 在 5% 时 AUROC=0.71 弱于 lz*（0.78）是因为 token-level 信号在极低污染时被\n    noise 淹没， 但在 20%+ 时 token distribution shift 变得明显，超过 binary-level detection。 accuracy\n    z-score 作为 same-level binary baseline 在所有水平都远不如 lz*—— 它只看 total score 而非 pattern，丢失了\n    item-level aberrance 信息。 这确立了 IRT structure 作为 binary-only 方法的关键 advantage。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: AUROC Comparison Across Contamination Levels (MMLU, averaged over\n      4 models)'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - info_level\n    - auroc_5pct\n    - auroc_10pct\n    - auroc_15pct\n    - auroc_25pct\n    rows:\n    - - lz*_θ-fixed\n      - binary\n      - 0.78±0.03\n      - 0.87±0.03\n      - 0.92±0.02\n      - 0.94±0.02\n    - - Min-K%++\n      - token_probs\n      - 0.71±0.04\n      - 0.82±0.03\n      - 0.89±0.02\n      - 0.95±0.01\n    - - PPL-based\n      - log_probs\n      - 0.68±0.04\n      - 0.79±0.03\n      - 0.86±0.03\n      - 0.93±0.02\n    - - ConStat\n      - retest\n      - 0.65±0.05\n      - 0.76±0.04\n      - 0.83±0.03\n      - 0.91±0.02\n    - - LR (oracle)\n      - binary\n      - 0.62±0.05\n      - 0.74±0.04\n      - 0.84±0.03\n      - 0.92±0.02\n    - - RF (oracle)\n      - binary\n      - 0.59±0.06\n      - 0.72±0.04\n      - 0.82±0.03\n      - 0.91±0.02\n    - - Acc z-score\n      - binary\n      - 0.55±0.05\n      - 0.63±0.04\n      - 0.71±0.04\n      - 0.78±0.03\n    - - Random\n      - —\n      - 0.5\n      - 0.5\n      - 0.5\n      - 0.5\n  - name: 'Table: lz* Advantage Over Best Baseline at Each Level'\n    columns:\n    - contam_level\n    - best_baseline\n    - best_baseline_auroc\n    - lz_auroc\n    - delta\n    - significant\n    rows:\n    - - 5%\n      - Min-K%++\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.07\n      - p<0.05\n    - - 10%\n      - Min-K%++\n      - 0.82\n      - 0.87\n      - 0.05\n      - p<0.05\n    - - 15%\n      - Min-K%++\n      - 0.89\n      - 0.92\n      - 0.03\n      - p=0.08\n    - - 25%\n      - Min-K%++\n      - 0.95\n      - 0.94\n      - -0.01\n      - n.s.\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: AUROC curves (x=contamination%, y=AUROC) for all 7 methods, with bootstrap\n    95% CI bands; lz* dominates at ≤15%'\n  - 'Fig: Detection frontier diagram — x=information access level, y=AUROC@10%; shows\n    lz* achieving near-parity with token-level methods despite binary-only input'\n  - 'Fig: DeLong test p-value heatmap (pairwise method comparisons at each contamination\n    level)'\n  analysis: 'Best 档的 headline result：lz* 在实际关键的 5-10% 低污染率下无需任何标注数据或 token access\n    即胜过 supervised baselines 和 token-level methods。这验证了 IRT structure 作为 inductive\n    bias 在 data-scarce regime 的优势。crossover 发生在 ~20%——高于此水平时 Min-K%++ 的 token-level\n    signal 更强，但 20%+ 的污染在实际场景中已经很容易被 accuracy jump 发现。 关键 framing：lz* 在 \"检测困难\" 的低污染区间胜出，正是\n    minimal-information 方法最有价值的 regime。\n\n    '\n- name: Post-RL Signal Retention\n  plan_id: exp-post-rl\n  description: 'Qwen3.5-9B 上先 SFT 污染（15%）再 GRPO 训练，测试 Δlz* 在 RL 后是否保持。 回应 Wang et\n    al. (2025) 的 MIA 全失效发现。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    pre_rl_delta_lz_fixed: 3.5\n    pre_rl_cohens_d: -3.95\n    pre_rl_accuracy_contam: 0.76\n    pre_rl_accuracy_seen: 0.86\n    post_rl_delta_lz_fixed: 2.8\n    post_rl_cohens_d: -3.15\n    post_rl_accuracy_contam: 0.79\n    post_rl_accuracy_seen: 0.82\n    signal_retention: 0.8\n    retention_above_70pct: true\n    min_k_pp_pre_rl_auroc: 0.89\n    min_k_pp_post_rl_auroc: 0.54\n    ppl_pre_rl_auroc: 0.86\n    ppl_post_rl_auroc: 0.52\n    lz_star_pre_rl_auroc: 0.92\n    lz_star_post_rl_auroc: 0.85\n    seen_accuracy_drop_post_rl: 0.04\n    unseen_accuracy_gain_post_rl: 0.03\n    memorization_fraction_post_rl: 0.34\n    theta_shift_post_rl: 0.28\n  result_rationale: 'Post-RL signal retention ≥70%（假设 3）成立的核心原因：GRPO 优化的是 reward signal（正确率/格式），\n    而非 item-level response distribution。SFT memorization 写入的是 \"看到 item X → 输出 answer\n    Y\" 的 pattern，这是 parameter-level 的 association。GRPO 的 policy gradient 更新主要影响 reasoning\n    chain 的 token distribution，而 binary correctness 层面的 memorization 痕迹 （hard item\n    仍然答对）大部分保留。signal 从 3.5 降到 2.8（retention=80%）的 20% 损失来自： (a) RL 训练中少量 seen items\n    的 memorization 被 \"覆盖\"（RL 发现了不同的 reasoning path）， (b) RL 普遍提升了 unseen items 的正确率（θ进一步上升），轻微压缩了\n    seen/unseen gap。 但关键是 binary response 层面的 aberrant pattern 仍然存在——模型在 \"不该答对\" 的\n    hard items 上 仍然答对，这个 pattern-level signal 是 RL 无法消除的，因为 RL 没有动机去 \"故意答错\" 已经答对的题。\n    相比之下，MIA methods（Min-K%++, PPL）失效是因为 RL 彻底重塑了 token-level distribution—— reasoning\n    tokens 的 perplexity 分布被 GRPO 重新优化，训练数据的 token-level fingerprint 消失。 这是 binary\n    vs token-level detection 的 structural advantage。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Pre-RL vs Post-RL Detection Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - info_level\n    - auroc_pre_rl\n    - auroc_post_rl\n    - retention_pct\n    rows:\n    - - lz*_θ-fixed\n      - binary\n      - 0.92\n      - 0.85\n      - 80%\n    - - Min-K%++\n      - token_probs\n      - 0.89\n      - 0.54\n      - 4%\n    - - PPL-based\n      - log_probs\n      - 0.86\n      - 0.52\n      - 2%\n    - - Acc z-score\n      - binary\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.65\n      - 60%\n    - - LR (oracle)\n      - binary\n      - 0.84\n      - 0.72\n      - 56%\n  - name: 'Table: Binary Response Patterns Pre/Post RL'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - pre_rl\n    - post_rl\n    - change\n    rows:\n    - - Δlz*_fixed\n      - 3.5\n      - 2.8\n      - -20%\n    - - Cohen's d\n      - -3.95\n      - -3.15\n      - -20%\n    - - Seen accuracy\n      - 0.86\n      - 0.82\n      - -4pp\n    - - Unseen accuracy\n      - 0.73\n      - 0.76\n      - +3pp\n    - - Memorization fraction\n      - 0.42\n      - 0.34\n      - -8pp\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Side-by-side lz* distributions (pre-RL vs post-RL) showing signal compression\n    but retention'\n  - 'Fig: Method comparison bar chart — AUROC pre/post RL for all methods, showing\n    MIA collapse vs lz* retention'\n  - 'Fig: Item-level analysis — scatter plot of P(correct) change per item, colored\n    by seen/unseen'\n  analysis: '这是论文最强的 selling point 之一。Wang et al. (2025) 证明所有 10 种 log-prob based\n    methods 在 RL 后降至 random，而 lz* 保留 80% 信号。这直接证明了 minimal-information operating point\n    的 structural advantage：binary patterns 对 RL 是 robust 的，因为 RL 优化的是 generation quality\n    而非 item-level correctness erasure。paper 可以引用此结果 直接回应 Wang et al. 的 \"all methods\n    fail\" claim——\"all TOKEN-LEVEL methods fail, but BINARY-LEVEL detection survives.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Multiscale lzm Statistic\n  plan_id: exp-multiscale-lzm\n  description: '实现 Hong, Lin & Cheng (2021) 的 multiscale lzm——跨 benchmark 聚合的标准化 lz*\n    总分。 在 PSN-IRT 12 模型和 ctrl-contam 模型上验证。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    gemini15_lzm: 42.8\n    deepseek_v3_lzm: 38.2\n    yi_lightning_lzm: 35.6\n    qwen_plus_lzm: 33.1\n    doubao_pro_lzm: -8.4\n    mistral_7b_lzm: 2.1\n    lzm_vs_mean_lz_correlation: 0.97\n    lzm_flagged_at_alpha005: 11/12\n    ctrl_contam_lzm_clean: 8.5\n    ctrl_contam_lzm_15pct: 14.2\n    ctrl_contam_lzm_50pct: 22.8\n    lzm_cohens_d_15pct: -4.12\n    lzm_incremental_over_single_benchmark: +0.15 AUROC vs single-best benchmark\n  result_rationale: 'lzm 聚合跨 benchmark 信号的原理：如果一个模型在多个 benchmarks 上都表现异常， lzm 将这些独立\n    signals 标准化后求和，产生比任何单一 benchmark 更强的检测统计量。 在 best 档下，ctrl-contam 跨 3 个 benchmarks\n    都注入了污染，lzm 的 multi-benchmark aggregation 产生额外的 +0.15 AUROC 增益。对 PSN-IRT 12 模型，lzm\n    与 mean_lz* 高度相关（r=0.97） 因为大多数模型的 anomaly 在所有 benchmarks 上方向一致（positive direction\n    dominant, 93.3% cells）。 Doubao-pro 的负 lzm 反映其独特的 negative lz* 模式（STEM 和 Humanities\n    domains 特异性不足）。 这是一个 methodological addition（不是核心贡献），但增强了 paper 的 completeness。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: lzm Scores for PSN-IRT 12 Models'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - lz_mmlu\n    - lz_hellaswag\n    - lz_gsm8k\n    - lz_arc_c\n    - lz_humaneval\n    - lzm_aggregate\n    rows:\n    - - Gemini-1.5\n      - 31.8\n      - 28.4\n      - 12.1\n      - 6.2\n      - -2.4\n      - 42.8\n    - - DeepSeek-V3\n      - 28.6\n      - 25.1\n      - 10.8\n      - 5.8\n      - -1.2\n      - 38.2\n    - - Yi-Lightning\n      - 26.4\n      - 22.3\n      - 9.5\n      - -0.3\n      - -1.8\n      - 35.6\n    - - Doubao-Pro\n      - -12.5\n      - -8.2\n      - 4.3\n      - -2.1\n      - -3.8\n      - -8.4\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: lzm bar chart for 12 models, sorted by magnitude, with 95% CI error bars'\n  - 'Fig: lzm vs mean(lz*) scatter showing near-perfect correlation but information-theoretic\n    gain from proper weighting'\n  analysis: 'lzm 提供了一个 principled 的跨 benchmark 聚合方式，比简单 mean(lz*) 有理论优势 （proper variance\n    weighting）。在 ctrl-contam 中，multi-benchmark contamination 的 lzm 检测力比 single-best\n    benchmark 强 0.15 AUROC，证明了 multiscale 方法的实用价值。 但核心贡献仍是 per-benchmark lz*，lzm 作为\n    extension/robustness check。\n\n    '\n- name: Extra Benchmarks (BBH + MATH)\n  plan_id: exp-extra-benchmarks\n  description: 'BBH (6,511 items) 和 MATH (5,000 items) 扩展，填充 1K-10K items 的 power\n    gap。 在 ctrl-contam 模型上验证中等规模 benchmark 的检测力。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    bbh_theoretical_power_15pct: 0.88\n    math_theoretical_power_15pct: 0.82\n    bbh_actual_power_15pct: 0.85\n    math_actual_power_15pct: 0.78\n    bbh_cohens_d_15pct: -3.21\n    math_cohens_d_15pct: -2.88\n    bbh_memorization_fraction: 0.4\n    math_memorization_fraction: 0.36\n    R2_with_new_benchmarks: 0.968\n    bbh_dose_response_monotonic_theta_fixed: true\n    math_dose_response_monotonic_theta_fixed: true\n    bbh_theta_fixed_ratio: 2.72\n    math_theta_fixed_ratio: 2.58\n  result_rationale: 'BBH（6511 items）和 MATH（5000 items）填充了 GSM8K（1319）和 MMLU（14042）之间的\n    gap。 在 best 档下，两者都产生显著检测信号：BBH 因为 items 多且区分度高（BIG-Bench Hard 的 items 被设计为 challenging），theoretical\n    power 接近 90%；MATH 的 items 更结构化（数学题）， memorization fraction 稍低（0.36 vs 0.40）因为数学题的\n    SFT 更容易产生 generalization 而非 verbatim memorization。两者的加入使 power function 的 R² 从\n    0.957 提升到 0.968， 进一步验证了 Claim 2 的 power ∝ f(n_items) 关系。这些中等规模 benchmarks 是实际应用中最常见的尺寸范围（多数\n    benchmarks 在 1K-10K 之间），因此验证至关重要。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Extended Power Function Validation'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - n_items\n    - theoretical_power_15pct\n    - actual_power_ctrl\n    - cohens_d_15pct\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 14042\n      - 0.985\n      - 0.92\n      - -3.95\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 10042\n      - 0.753\n      - 0.71\n      - -2.64\n    - - BBH\n      - 6511\n      - 0.88\n      - 0.85\n      - -3.21\n    - - MATH\n      - 5000\n      - 0.82\n      - 0.78\n      - -2.88\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 1319\n      - 0.59\n      - 0.55\n      - -1.42\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Updated power function curve with 5 benchmark points (adding BBH, MATH),\n    showing improved R²=0.968 fit'\n  - 'Fig: Detection signal (|Cohen''s d|) vs n_items scatter plot, confirming monotonic\n    relationship'\n  analysis: 'BBH 和 MATH 的加入完善了 power function 的中间区段验证。5 个 benchmarks 覆盖了 1.3K 到 14K\n    items 的完整范围，R²=0.968 确认 power 与 √n 的理论关系在实际 ctrl-contam 中成立。 这直接支撑 Claim 2 的核心论断：detection\n    power is a predictable function of benchmark size。\n\n    '\n- name: Natural Experiment (base→chat pairs)\n  plan_id: exp-natural-experiment\n  description: 'v1 leaderboard base→chat model pairs 计算 Δlz* = lz*(chat) - lz*(base)\n    作为 SFT 效应代理。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_pairs: 21\n    n_complete_pairs: 9\n    hellaswag_systematic_effect:\n      mean_deviation: -3.8\n      t_stat: -4.2\n      p_value: 0.0008\n      direction: SFT decreases person-fit\n    gsm8k_systematic_effect:\n      mean_deviation: 4.5\n      t_stat: 3.8\n      p_value: 0.004\n      direction: SFT increases person-fit\n    mmlu_effect:\n      p_value: 0.12\n      direction: non-significant\n    arc_c_effect:\n      p_value: 0.31\n      direction: non-significant\n    individual_outlier_pairs: 1\n    outlier_model: codellama-34b-instruct\n    outlier_benchmark: GSM8K\n    outlier_delta_lz: 8.7\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 natural experiment 的结果比 registry 中的实际结果稍强：HellaSwag 和\n    GSM8K 显示更清晰的 systematic SFT effect（p<0.001 和 p<0.005），且出现一个 individual outlier\n    （codellama-34b-instruct 在 GSM8K 上 Δlz*=8.7，远超 group mean）。这个 outlier 的出现是 best\n    档独有的——它提供了 \"自然实验中发现疑似污染\" 的 case study evidence。 HellaSwag 的 negative shift 解释：chat\n    SFT 训练中包含了对话/常识推理数据， 这些与 HellaSwag 的 commonsense completion task 有 domain overlap，导致泛化性提升\n    但 pattern 变得 less aberrant（更符合 IRT 预测）。GSM8K positive shift： chat 模型的 math instruction\n    tuning 不是 benchmark-specific memorization 而是 reasoning capability，但少数模型可能直接接触了\n    GSM8K items。 由于 a_r=0.111 的 discrimination failure，此实验只能作为 converging evidence，不是\n    primary claim。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Systematic SFT Effects on lz* (base→chat)'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - n_pairs\n    - mean_Δlz\n    - t_stat\n    - p_value\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 9\n      - -3.8\n      - -4.2\n      - 0.0008\n      - SFT improves commonsense (less aberrant)\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 9\n      - 4.5\n      - 3.8\n      - 0.004\n      - Math SFT creates new aberrance patterns\n    - - MMLU\n      - 9\n      - 1.8\n      - 1.7\n      - 0.12\n      - n.s.\n    - - ARC-C\n      - 9\n      - 0.9\n      - 1.1\n      - 0.31\n      - n.s.\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Paired Δlz* plot (base→chat) for each benchmark, with individual pair lines\n    and group mean ± CI'\n  analysis: 'P2-optional 实验。提供了 real-world SFT 效应的 converging evidence，但受限于 a_r=0.111\n    的 discrimination failure。在 paper 中作为 supplementary finding 而非 primary evidence。\n\n    '\n- name: V1 IRT Refit Expanded (N=178)\n  plan_id: exp-v1-irt-refit-expanded\n  description: '扩大 v1 IRT 重拟合样本量至 N≥178，最终验证 Path D（large-scale audit）是否可行。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_models: 178\n    n_items: 14042\n    3pl_a_pearson_r: 0.13\n    2pl_a_pearson_r: -0.03\n    3pl_b_pearson_r: 0.66\n    a_r_below_threshold: true\n    conclusion: Path D confirmed dead. Classical MML-EM cannot recover IRT discrimination\n      from LLM response data at available sample sizes.\n  result_rationale: '即使在 best 档，Path D（leaderboard-scale audit via classical IRT refit）仍然失败。\n    这不是 experiment failure 而是 honest negative result：classical IRT estimation 需要 hundreds\n    of examinees with similar ability distributions，而 LLM response data 的特殊性（模型间 ability\n    range 极大，item response 非 locally independent） 使得 MML-EM 无法恢复 discrimination parameters。a_r=0.13\n    << 0.4 threshold 确认 discriminability failure 不是样本量问题而是 structural incompatibility。\n    这本身是 Claim 3(c) 的贡献：quantifying the estimation challenge for neural IRT。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: IRT Parameter Recovery (Classical vs PSN-IRT)'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - N_models\n    - a_pearson_r\n    - b_pearson_r\n    - conclusion\n    rows:\n    - - MML-EM 3PL (N=63)\n      - 63\n      - 0.111\n      - 0.626\n      - a failure\n    - - MML-EM 3PL (N=178)\n      - 178\n      - 0.13\n      - 0.66\n      - a failure persists\n    - - PSN-IRT (neural)\n      - 12\n      - validated\n      - validated\n      - reference standard\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Scatter plot of MML-EM a_hat vs PSN-IRT a_true for N=178, showing near-zero\n    correlation'\n  analysis: 'Path D 的确定性关闭是 paper structure 的关键节点。它确立了 \"why ctrl-contam, not leaderboard\n    audit\" 的 methodological justification，并为 Future Work 中的 \"neural IRT at scale\"\n    提供了动机。\n\n    '\n- name: 4PL vs 3PL Ablation\n  plan_id: exp-4pl-ablation\n  description: '4PL vs 3PL(d=1) 消融实验：量化 d 参数对检测灵敏度的影响。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    mean_power_gain_4pl_vs_3pl:\n      MMLU: +28pp\n      HellaSwag: +27pp\n      GSM8K: +21pp\n      ARC_C: +15pp\n      HumanEval: +14pp\n    far_4pl: 0.05\n    far_3pl: 0.05-0.17 (inflated)\n    far_2pl: 0.50-1.00 (catastrophic)\n    items_with_d_lt_095_mmlu: 46%\n    ctrl_contam_4pl_d_15pct: -3.95\n    ctrl_contam_3pl_d_15pct: -1.82\n    power_loss_without_d: 54%\n  result_rationale: '4PL 的 d 参数（upper asymptote）对高能力 LLM 至关重要：当 d<1 时，P(correct) 的上限低于\n    1.0， 高能力模型在这些 items 上 \"应该\" 答错（按 4PL 预测）。如果忽略 d（设 d=1）， model 预测所有高能力模型都应该答对所有题——这会让\n    few errors 变成 extreme aberrance（false alarm）。 MMLU 46% items 有 d<0.95 意味着将近一半的题目有上限效应，忽略这些会产生巨大的\n    FAR 膨胀。 在 best 档下，ctrl-contam 进一步确认：同一污染实验用 3PL 分析时 |d| 从 3.95 降到 1.82， 因为 3PL\n    的 inflated null variance 稀释了真实信号。这证明 4PL 不是 \"nice-to-have\" 而是 LLM person-fit 分析的\n    necessary condition。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 4PL vs 3PL Detection Performance'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - n_items\n    - power_4pl_25pct\n    - power_3pl_25pct\n    - gain\n    - pct_items_d_lt_095\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 14042\n      - 0.776\n      - 0.329\n      - +44.7pp\n      - 46%\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 10042\n      - 0.534\n      - 0.28\n      - +25.4pp\n      - 38%\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 1319\n      - 0.73\n      - 0.334\n      - +39.6pp\n      - 42%\n    - - ARC-C\n      - 295\n      - 0.132\n      - 0.091\n      - +4.1pp\n      - 29%\n    - - HumanEval\n      - 164\n      - 0.318\n      - 0.165\n      - +15.3pp\n      - 35%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Power comparison curves (4PL solid, 3PL dashed) across contamination levels\n    for each benchmark'\n  - 'Fig: Item-level analysis — d parameter distribution histogram with 0.95 threshold\n    marked'\n  analysis: '4PL ablation 是 methodological rigor 的体现。Reviewer 可能质疑 \"为什么不用更简单的 3PL\"，\n    此实验给出定量答案：+28pp average power gain，54% signal loss without d。 结合 exp-4pl-real-data-degradation（r=0.225\n    between 4PL/3PL lz*）， establishes 4PL 作为 LLM person-fit 的 minimum viable parameterization。\n\n    '\n- name: Baseline Comparison — Accuracy Z-Score (completed)\n  plan_id: exp-baseline-comparison\n  description: 'Accuracy z-score 作为 same-level binary-only baseline 的扩展对比， 整合入完整 baseline\n    comparison 实验中。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    acc_zscore_auroc_5pct: 0.55\n    acc_zscore_auroc_10pct: 0.63\n    acc_zscore_auroc_15pct: 0.71\n    acc_zscore_auroc_25pct: 0.78\n    lz_star_advantage_over_zscore_5pct: +0.23 AUROC\n    lz_star_advantage_over_zscore_15pct: +0.21 AUROC\n    lz_star_advantage_over_zscore_25pct: +0.16 AUROC\n  result_rationale: 'Accuracy z-score 只利用 total score（sum of binary responses）而丢失所有\n    item-level pattern information。lz* 的优势正来自于 item-level aberrance detection： 它区分\n    \"总分高因为答对了该对的题\" vs \"总分高因为答对了不该对的题\"。 在 5% 低污染时，只有 ~700 items（14042×5%）被 contaminate，total\n    score change 微乎其微 （+2-3 pp accuracy），z-score 几乎无法检测。但 lz* 能捕捉到这 700 items 中的 \"不可能正确\"\n    模式。 这是 \"IRT structure as inductive bias\" 的最直接证明。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: lz* vs accuracy z-score ROC curves at 5% and 15% contamination, showing\n    consistent lz* advantage'\n  analysis: 'Accuracy z-score 是 \"straw-man\" 但也是 fair comparison：它是唯一的 same-information-level\n    baseline （binary only, no training data）。lz* 的 consistent +0.16-0.23 AUROC advantage\n    直接证明 IRT item parameters 提供了有价值的 structural information。\n\n    '\n- name: Domain-Level Analysis\n  plan_id: exp-domain-analysis\n  description: 'MMLU domain-level 分析：按 subject category 分别计算 person-fit，识别污染的 domain\n    分布。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    gemini_subjects_flagged: 50/57 (87.7%)\n    gemini_contamination_uniform: true\n    gemini_category_lz_range:\n    - 15.3\n    - 21.2\n    ctrl_contam_domain_uniformity: uniform (as expected, since QLoRA trains on random\n      15% sample)\n    ctrl_contam_stem_lz: 3.8\n    ctrl_contam_humanities_lz: 3.3\n    ctrl_contam_social_sci_lz: 3.5\n    ctrl_contam_other_lz: 3.2\n    doubao_selective_domains: true\n    doubao_negative_pattern: STEM and Humanities strongly negative, Other positive\n  result_rationale: 'Domain analysis 在 best 档下产生两个 clear findings：(1) Gemini-1.5 的\n    contamination 是 uniform across domains（所有 subject 都被 memorize），consistent with\n    \"bulk training data leak\" 而非 \"selective domain tuning\"；(2) ctrl-contam 模型的 domain-level\n    signal 也是 uniform （因为 QLoRA 训练样本是 randomly sampled across all subjects），验证了实验设计的\n    internal consistency。 Doubao 的 selective negative pattern 则展示了不同类型的 anomaly：可能是\n    domain-specific training data 导致某些 domains 泛化过强（lz*<0 = over-consistent pattern）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: MMLU Domain-Level lz* (Gemini-1.5 vs Ctrl-Contam)'\n    columns:\n    - domain\n    - gemini_lz\n    - ctrl_contam_15_lz\n    - ctrl_contam_clean_lz\n    rows:\n    - - STEM\n      - 21.2\n      - 3.8\n      - 0.1\n    - - Humanities\n      - 17.9\n      - 3.3\n      - -0.2\n    - - Social Sciences\n      - 15.9\n      - 3.5\n      - 0.0\n    - - Other\n      - 15.3\n      - 3.2\n      - 0.1\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Heatmap of domain-level lz* across models (rows=models, cols=57 MMLU subjects),\n    color=lz*'\n  - 'Fig: Ctrl-contam domain uniformity test — bar chart showing no significant domain\n    variation (χ² test)'\n  analysis: 'Domain analysis 提供了 contamination 的 \"spatial resolution\"：从 aggregate\n    model-level detection 到 domain-level localization。在 paper 中服务于两个目的：(a) 验证 ctrl-contam\n    内部一致性 （random sampling → uniform signal），(b) case study 中展示不同 contamination type\n    的 domain fingerprint。\n\n    '\n- name: Leaderboard Audit (Abandoned)\n  plan_id: exp-leaderboard-audit\n  description: 'Open LLM Leaderboard v1 大规模 13K+ 模型扫描。因 IRT refit failure 放弃。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: ABANDONED\n    reason: a_r=0.111 discrimination failure makes lz* degenerate to accuracy-like\n      metric at scale\n    paper_treatment: Data availability noted in Discussion/Future Work; 13K+ per-item\n      data available for future neural IRT estimation\n  result_rationale: '即使在 best 档，leaderboard audit 仍然 abandoned。这不影响 best 档的叙事， 因为\n    ctrl-contam 提供了比 leaderboard audit 更强的 ground-truth validation。 Audit 的 abandonment\n    本身是 honest negative result (Claim 3c)：classical IRT 的 sample size requirement\n    与 LLM evaluation ecosystem 不兼容。 Paper 中将其定位为 \"future work when neural IRT estimation\n    at scale becomes feasible\"。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: ABANDONED。在 paper 中转化为 methodological contribution：量化了 classical vs neural\n    IRT 在 LLM context 中的 gap，为 future work 提供了 concrete roadmap（13K+ data available,\n    awaiting better estimation methods）。\n","numLines":1075,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1075}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01NisYrWrYCnxp4qcaGcuTVu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me carefully review this paper and then submit the review report. Let me first load the submit tool schema, then compose my review.\n\nThe paper is \"IRT-FIT: Detecting Benchmark Contamination in LLMs from Binary Response Patterns Alone.\" Let me analyze it systematically.\n\nLet me check the review context YAML against what's in the paper to assess coverage, then write a thorough review.\n\nKey observations from reading:\n\n**Strengths:**\n1. Novel and well-motivated connection between psychometric person-fit analysis and LLM contamination detection\n2. Strong controlled contamination experimental design across 4 model families × 6 levels × 3 benchmarks\n\n\n3. The θ-shift identification and resolution represents a genuine methodological advance\n4. The post-RL signal retention finding—80% versus near-random for token-based methods—is particularly compelling and timely\n5. Power function validation achieving R²=0.968 provides practical utility\n6. Commendable transparency in reporting negative results, including IRT parameter recovery failures and the decision to abandon leaderboard auditing\n7. The paper is clearly written and well-organized throughout\n\n**Weaknesses:**\n1. **IRT parameter dependency**: The method's reliance on validated 4PL parameters from PSN-IRT creates a significant bottleneck, as these are only available for a handful of benchmarks, which substantially constrains real-world applicability despite the paper's acknowledgment of this limitation.\n\n2. **Controlled contamination diverges from real-world scenarios**: While the QLoRA SFT injection at known percentages provides clean experimental conditions, actual contamination during large-scale pretraining involves unknown data mixtures that this controlled setup doesn't capture, limiting the threat model's practical relevance.\n\n3. **θ-fixed analysis assumes access to clean baselines**: The method requires knowing the model's ability from uncontaminated data, but practitioners suspecting contamination typically lack this baseline—a practical gap the paper doesn't adequately resolve.\n\n4. **Limited RL validation**: Testing only GRPO on a single model (Qwen3.5-9B) for the post-RL experiments is insufficient to generalize the findings, especially compared to Wang et al.'s broader evaluation across multiple RL methods.\n\n5. **Oracle baseline comparison raises fairness concerns**: The LR and RF baselines receive ground truth contamination labels yet still underperform IRT-FIT at low contamination rates, suggesting potential class imbalance issues at 5% contamination that may disadvantage the oracle classifiers without proper rebalancing techniques.\n\n6. **Statistical methodology lacks transparency**: Bootstrap confidence interval computation details are missing, the Cohen's d formula isn't specified, and there's no mention of multiple comparison corrections.\n\n7. **Natural experiment validation is compromised**: The acknowledged discrimination failure (ar=0.111) undermines the reliability of conclusions drawn from only 9 pairs in this section.\n\n8. **Standalone Limitations section missing**: EMNLP requires a dedicated Limitations section, but the paper only includes a limitations paragraph within the Discussion, which could trigger desk rejection concerns.\n\n9. **Reference coverage is insufficient**: With only 6 citations, the paper misses opportunities to engage with broader literature on person-fit statistics, IRT applications in NLP/LLM evaluation, and alternative contamination detection approaches.\n\n10. **No reproducibility statement**: The paper lacks code and data availability information.\n\n11. **Minimal-information framing oversells the approach**: While binary responses are indeed minimal information, the method still depends on 4PL item parameters derived from neural IRT trained on substantial data.\n\n12. **Multiscale lzm contribution feels incremental**: The brief Section 4.7 shows only a modest +0.15 AUROC improvement, suggesting it was added for completeness rather than providing meaningful gains.\n\n13. **HellaSwag power anomaly needs clarification**: Table 9 shows HellaSwag with 10,042 items having lower theoretical power (0.753) than smaller benchmarks like BBH (0.88) and MATH (0.82), which contradicts the expected relationship between benchmark size and power—likely due to item discrimination differences that aren't explained.\n\n14. **Page count**: The paper is 9 pages with references starting partway through page 9, putting the main text slightly over the 8-page EMNLP 2026 limit for main content.\n\nNow checking how well the experiments align with what was planned—all six core experiments are accounted for across sections 4.1 through 4.5.\n\nAssessing the work on the ARR scale: the methodology is reasonably sound overall but has some limitations like the fixed-θ baseline assumption and relying on a single RL approach, plus that odd power function behavior with HellaSwag. The novelty is solid with the cross-disciplinary angle and good timing relative to current trends, though there's room for stronger impact.\n\nOn reproducibility, I'm concerned about the lack of code availability and sparse details on the PSN-IRT parameters and contamination protocol specifics. The paper lands at a 3.5 overall—borderline for conference acceptance. It's got genuine novelty and well-controlled experiments, but the practical constraints around PSN-IRT dependency and the θ-fixed requirement, combined with methodological gaps, keep it from being a clear accept. Addressing the deployment story and testing more RL methods would strengthen it considerably.\n\nActually, stepping back—the core strengths are pretty compelling: this is a truly novel connection between IRT person-fit and LLM contamination detection, the experiments are comprehensive and well-controlled, and the timing is right for this kind of work. post-RL robustness and honest negative results. The weaknesses are real but properly disclosed—some are inherent limitations. I think 3.5 is fair, sitting between Findings and Conference level. The paper has novelty that pushes it above Findings quality, but practical constraints keep it from a clear conference accept.\n\nActually, looking more carefully, this is quite strong work. The experimental setup is rigorous with 4 models across 6 levels and multiple benchmarks, the θ-shift insight is genuinely novel, and the post-RL results are compelling. The limitations are transparently discussed. My main hesitation is practical applicability—needing PSN-IRT parameters—plus the sparse reference list. I'm settling on 3.5 leaning toward 4.\n\nSoundness gets a 4, excitement is 3.5, reproducibility is 3, and overall comes to 3.5. Now I'm preparing to submit the review.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":39651,"cache_read_input_tokens":23828,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":39651},"output_tokens":17,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"95beeaab-bb88-4eb2-a0bf-c2e8f7ef96cd","uuid":"a0af8076-a4a5-4398-9465-a969828922a1"}
